sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant M as Mic loop
  participant R as Router
  participant L as LLM
  participant T as TTS
  participant P as Player
  U->>M: speaks
  M->>R: final transcript only
  R->>L: no regex match
  L-->>T: short reply streams in
  T-->>P: audio
  P->>U: reply plays, mic stays open
  U->>M: talks over the reply
  M->>P: stop playback
  M->>R: new sentence becomes next request
  P-->>M: ended event reopens mic
